questions.questionText:
Find the solution (x, y, z) for the following system of equations:

x &minus; y + z = 2;

2x &minus; y &minus; z = &minus;6;

2x + 2y + z = &minus;3

questions.questionTextHi:
समीकरणों की निम्नलिखित प्रणाली के लिए हल (x, y, z) ज्ञात कीजिए:

x &minus; y + z = 2;

2x &minus; y &minus; z = &minus;6;

2x + 2y + z = &minus;3

